# Web3Forms contact form access key (https://web3forms.com — free tier,
# 250 submissions/month, no server-side code needed).
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your real access key.
# The `.env` file is gitignored; the key is a client-side publish key that is
# embedded into the built site — that is expected for Web3Forms.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key_here
